{
  "_comment": "FUT Objectives (the FIFA 21 Seasonal Campaign, SCMP): a welcome objective group served already completed, grind objective groups tracked from match ends, SBC submissions and pack openings, dated one-off gifts, and a Season Progress level track. Phase 1 values: pack-odds-2026-09 PLAN.md 5.5 and 6.",
  "campaign": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Aurora 21 Season",
    "startedDaysAgo": 30,
    "endsInDays": 365
  },
  "category": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Objectives"
  },
  "_groupComment": "Group rows use FIFA 21's numeric group states and ObjectiveGroupType.SEASONAL (0 is INVALID). A group is COMPLETED only once every objective in it is redeemed.",
  "groupType": 3,
  "groupStates": {
    "inProgress": 1,
    "completed": 2,
    "rewarded": 4
  },
  "_welcomeGroupComment": "The group reward tile shows rewardPackCount x rewardPackId. Claiming it delivers those packs to My Packs (untradeable when rewardUntradeable) plus xpAward season XP. Phase 1 (owner D3): 3 x 513, the 82+ pick (1 of 4), untradeable. With stat and target the club earns it first (owner 2026-09-29: Kick Off needs one match): until then the group is a tracked objective and claiming pays nothing.",
  "welcomeGroup": {
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Welcome Objectives",
    "subTitle": "Get started in FUT",
    "objective": {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Kick Off",
      "description": "Play a match in FUT."
    },
    "rewardPackId": 513,
    "rewardPackCount": 3,
    "rewardUntradeable": true,
    "xpAward": 1500,
    "stat": "matches",
    "target": 1
  },
  "_noProgressEndReasonsComment": "Matches ending with these end reasons count nothing for objectives. Season XP comes from completed matches (each mode's completion reward, set under Modes) and claimed objectives; SBCs and opened packs earn none.",
  "noProgressEndReasons": [
    "QUIT",
    "NO_CONTEST"
  ],
  "_maxGoalsPerMatchComment": "The most goals one match end counts for objectives (goal stats and the goal-bound player stats): FIFA reports them, so a crafted match end could otherwise claim any number and finish every goal objective at once.",
  "maxGoalsPerMatch": 20,
  "_liveProgressUpdatesComment": "liveProgressUpdates: match end, pack open and SBC submit replies carry the objectives that moved and the Season XP gained (retail dynamicObjectivesUpdates), so progress shows without leaving FUT. false = progress shows on the next FUT entry only.",
  "liveProgressUpdates": true,
  "_statLabelsComment": "Objective descriptions by tracked stat; {n} is the target with thousands separators.",
  "statLabels": {
    "assists": "Assist {n} goals in FUT matches.",
    "matches": "Play {n} matches in FUT.",
    "wins": "Win {n} matches in FUT.",
    "goals": "Score {n} goals in FUT matches.",
    "cleanSheets": "Keep {n} clean sheets.",
    "draftWins": "Win {n} FUT Draft matches.",
    "sbcs": "Complete {n} Squad Building Challenges.",
    "packs": "Open {n} packs.",
    "scoringMatches": "Score at least one goal in {n} separate FUT matches."
  },
  "_grindGroupsComment": "Each objective pays its award (coins, or a pack delivered to My Packs, untradeable when the award says so) and xp once its stat reaches target; the group award pays once every objective in it is claimed. A reward may pay coins, FIFA Points (fifaPoints) and packs (packs: [{packId, count, untradeable}], or the older single pack), plus the My Stadium extras. A group's stats count from when it first went live (migration 143; groups live before then count from the club's creation). Pack ids are FIFA 21 reward packs: 402 Jumbo Rare Players, 403 Mega, 404 Rare Mega, 405 Ultimate, 542 TOTW Player (1 in-form), 543 Small Rare Gold Players, and 513-516 the 82+-88+ player picks. Group 8, New Club, is the permanent version of the week-one group, so a club gets the same start whenever it joins. SBC completion counts once per challenge per club ever (repeat completions pay rewards but add no sbcs progress), so an sbcs target above the visible challenge count can never be met. Groups 20-22 are retail's Stadium Development milestones: each objective opens My Stadium slots (unlockSlots, rules/club.json myStadiumSlots ids) and pays a pack of My Stadium items (vanity: count unowned items of those card subtypes); groups 20 and 21 move the club up a FUT Stadium tier (stadiumTier, venues.futStadiums 444 Challengers and 445 Champions). Group 20 follows retail (fifauteam.com milestones); groups 21 and 22 are reconstructed (no retail list survives) to open every remaining slot by 85 matches and 60 wins.",
